  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "なぞおおき　きょうぼうな　せいぶつ。ふるい　たんけんきに　しるされたみずの　かいぶつから　なづけられた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "수수께끼에 둘러싸인 흉포한 생물. 오래된 탐험기에 기록된 물의 괴물의 이름을 따서 명명되었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "充滿謎團的凶暴生物。名字來自古老的探險記裡記載的水之怪物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cette créature violente entourée de mystère tire son nom d’un monstre aquatique évoqué dans un vieux récit d’exploration.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Diese rätselhafte und wilde Kreatur ist nach einem Wassermonster benannt, das in einem alten Expeditionsbericht beschrieben wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una criatura violenta rodeada de misterio, cuyo nombre se inspira en cierto monstruo acuático mencionado en un viejo diario de exploración.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Feroce creatura avvolta nel mistero. Il suo nome è ispirato a un mostro acquatico menzionato in un antico diario di viaggio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This ferocious creature is shrouded in mystery. It’s named after an aquatic monster mentioned in an old expedition journal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "謎多き　凶暴な　生物。古い　探検記に　記された水の　怪物から　名付けられた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "充满谜团的残暴生物。名字来源于古老探险记中所记载的水之怪物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una criatura violenta rodeada de misterio, cuyo nombre se inspira en cierto monstruo acuático mencionado en un viejo diario de exploración.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ちょうこだいの　スイクンの　すがたとオカルトざっしが　けいさいしたイラストに　にた　すがたをしている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "초고대의 스이쿤이라며 오컬트 잡지에 게재됐던 일러스트와 비슷한 모습을 하고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "樣子與超自然雜誌所刊登的插圖中的超古代水君很相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble à l’illustration du Suicune d’un passé lointain qui figure dans une revue consacrée aux phénomènes paranormaux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ähnelt einer Illustration aus einer esoterischen Zeitschrift, die ein urzeitliches Suicune abbildet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se asemeja a la ilustración de un Suicune de tiempos inmemoriales que apareció publicada en cierta revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo aspetto ricorda un’illustrazione che, stando alla rivista di paranormale che l’ha pubblicata, raffigurerebbe un antichissimo Suicune.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It resembles an illustration published in a paranormal magazine, said to be a depiction of a super-ancient Suicune.",
